Deut 15:1 , The seventh year a year of release for the poor;
Deut 15:7 , It must be no let of lending or giving;
Deut 15:12 , An Hebrew servant, except he will not depart, must in the seventh year go forth free and well furnished;
Deut 15:19 , All firstling males of the cattle are to be sanctified unto the Lord.
